I just received a note this morning from the author of the hunt game that
was recently posted to comp.sources.games.  He said that the posted version
had several bugs in it and that he was in the process of fixing up the game
and adding new capability (e.g. to be able to run on SysV machines that
support sockets).  He also said that he would make it available for posting
on comp.sources.games when it is ready and requested that I cancel the
currently posted version to prevent its widespread distribution, which I
have done.  So look forward to seeing the new improved version in the near
future.

